{"parentUuid":"b3f7eceb-a282-47f8-a593-b81c1fc89f95","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"ab095323a3b740c00","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DgaH7PcgyGVNkb76WETo8P","type":"tool_result","content":"statement: >-\n  A sub-agent's records go to its own transcript file beside the session's,\n  not into the session's, together with a sidecar naming its type, the call\n  that spawned it and its depth.\nproviders:\n  claude:\n    docs:\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/claude-directory#application-data\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/sub-agents#resume-subagents\n    runs:\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/meta\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/hookerrors\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/bgagent\n  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b6d90734-812f-400f-93d6-dd663342598f","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:17:57.254Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b3f7eceb-a282-47f8-a593-b81c1fc89f95","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ab095323a3b740c00","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a11c0a040e3cf682b"}
