{"parentUuid":"d31b1174-0cf7-4e46-a3df-138b49c3c1f8","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"ab095323a3b740c00","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EDHDzxUrguthhGhYfFUrrn","type":"tool_result","content":"statement: >-\n  A session can be resumed by id: it continues in its existing transcript,\n  even when resumed from another working directory, and a top-level resume\n  fires session hooks but no sub-agent hooks.\nproviders:\n  claude:\n    docs:\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/cli-reference#cli-flags\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/sessions#resume-by-id\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/headless#continue-conversations\n    runs:\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/forkresume\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/compact\n  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending\nstatement: >-\n  A sub-agent can itself dispatch sub-agents; each records its depth and its\n  parent, and all of a session's sub-agent transcripts sit in one directory.\n  Nesting stops at a depth limit (three layers by default, set by\n  CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_SUBAGENT_SPAWN_DEPTH), where a dispatch is an error, and in\n  non-interactive mode a sub-agent does not wait for the background sub-agents\n  it launched.\nproviders:\n  claude:\n    docs:\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/sub-agents#let-subagents-spawn-their-own-subagents\n    runs:\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/meta\n  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending\nspec/capabilities/subagent-lifecycle-hooks.yaml:24:    deviations:\nspec/capabilities/subagent-lifecycle-hooks.yaml-25-      - adr: capability-grounding\nspec/capabilities/subagent-lifecycle-hooks.yaml-26-        statement: >-\nspec/capabilities/subagent-lifecycle-hooks.yaml-27-          Codex's stop hook payload does not list the session's background tasks: it carries\nspec/capabilities/subagent-lifecycle-hooks.yaml-28-          the sub-agent's agent_transcript_path and last_assistant_message, and\n30:  https://code.claude.com/docs/en/sub-agents:","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f231a519-0d5d-4d8f-abf9-9d74ae7cf159","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:19:15.124Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d31b1174-0cf7-4e46-a3df-138b49c3c1f8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-ab095323a3b740c00","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a11c0a040e3cf682b"}
